ImageMatrix
Copyright 2026 Yukinoshita-lin

This product includes software developed by Yukinoshita-lin
(https://github.com/Yukinoshita-lin).

ImageMatrix is a Windows tool that converts images into numeric matrices
(R / G / B / grayscale) and restores images from those matrices, written
in pure C/C++ with a hand-written BMP codec and a Win32 API GUI.

This product is distributed with no third-party libraries. It depends only
on components shipped with the Microsoft Windows operating system:
Win32 API, GDI+ (system component), UCRT, and Common Controls v6.

